<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Desc raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Desc raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co said on Friday it had upgraded Mexico's Desc Sociedad de Fomento Industrial SA de CV to a buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We feel it's cheap at a 36 percent discount to the Mexican bolsa excluding Telmex and the results will surpass consensus&quot; the fourth quarter of 1996 and 1997, the firm wrote in analysis.</p>
<p>-- Desc was up 1/4 to 23-7/8 in New York trade.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
